WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.720
YouTube has some of the best teachers in the world.

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.323
Vortex gives you a way to learn from them.

3
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:12.789
Real courses, built from real lessons.

4
00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:18.676
Every video in the right order, and credited to the creator who made it.

5
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:23.247
Just ask, in plain English.

6
00:00:23.247 --> 00:00:27.140
Vortex finds the lesson, and the moment it's taught.

7
00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:31.532
Your place is saved to the second.

8
00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:34.146
So you can pick up right where you left off.

9
00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:40.502
When a video ends, a short quiz checks what stuck.

10
00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:42.871
Retake it until you pass.

11
00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.636
And for anything else, just describe your goal.

12
00:00:48.636 --> 00:00:51.180
Vortex builds you a plan.

13
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.477
Vortex.

14
00:00:54.477 --> 00:00:58.015
Learn anything, the way a course teaches it.
